# The class list: who is supposed to be in the room. Used only by
# `classnet roster check`, to report students who have no GitHub username on file
# and will therefore be turned away at the sign-in portal.
#
# A Canvas gradebook export works unchanged -- keep the header, and the
# "Points Possible" row Canvas puts second is skipped automatically:
#
#   Student,ID,SIS User ID,SIS Login ID,Section
#   "    Points Possible",,,,
#   "Smith, Jane",12345,20123456,jsmith,CS 326-01
#
# A plain list of addresses or usernames, one per line, works too.
# Matching ignores the domain, so a list of usernames matches a roster of
# addresses and vice versa.
#
# Install as /etc/classnet/enrolled.csv (gitignored: it is student data).
jsmith@dons.usfca.edu
alopez@dons.usfca.edu
